From 84254b3691169f424015832bd5b1972560cba8dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JingMatrix <jingmatrix@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 21:20:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/47] Add the Kotlin control daemon

A root app_process daemon harvests the device's real attestation parameters, resolves config.json into per-profile settings, injects the interceptor, and pushes the resolved config over the control channel, re-resolving on package and config changes. It also serves a loopback, token-guarded KeyAdmin endpoint the WebUI uses to list/inspect/delete stored keys and tail the TEESimulator logs. Install tasks accept -Pserial to target a device.
